# {{name}}

A turn-based text-first BeSpoke adventure built with `bespoke init {{name}} --template text`.

## Run and Test

```bash
zig build test
zig build run
zig build run -- --headless --ticks 10
```

## Browser Build

```bash
zig build web
node web/smoke.js
```

Serve `zig-out/web/` over HTTP, or pack it into one self-contained HTML file using `tools/pack_game_page.py` from the BeSpoke engine checkout.

